 @end example
 
 If the NBD server is located on the same host, you can use an unix socket instead
 of an inet socket:
 
 @example
-qemu-system-i386 linux.img -hdb nbd+unix://?socket=/tmp/my_socket
+qemu-kvm linux.img -hdb nbd+unix://?socket=/tmp/my_socket
 @end example
 
